<title>JAPAN: Krosaki -96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Krosaki -96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		     57.42		vs	   58.02</p>
<p> Operating	  243    million	  vs	    1.20</p>
<p> Current	    348    million	  vs	  673    million</p>
<p> Net		  156    million	  vs	  589    million</p>
<p> EPS			  2.40 yen	  vs	    9.03 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS		   -		vs		 -</p>
<p>NOTE - Krosaki Corp is a large manufacturer of firebricks,</p>
<p>mainly for steelmakers, and is affiliated with</p>
<p>Nippon Steel Corp.</p>
</text>
